cope":"independent_fixed_witness_occurrences","raw_mentions_preserved":true,"passage_count_scope":"annotation_containers","explanation":"頻次依已驗同底本同位置去重；原始錨點完整保留，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_details":[{"id":"sd-jin043-leguang-fang-staff","person_id":"415_m3h_x11","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-ws2618531-leguang","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:p001","quote":"樂廣，字彥輔，南陽淯陽人也。父方，參魏征西將軍夏侯玄軍事。廣時年八歲，玄常見廣在路，因呼與語，還謂方曰：「向見廣神姿郎徹，當為名士。卿家雖貧，可令專學，必能興卿門戶也。」方早卒。廣孤貧，僑居山陽，寒素為業，人無知者。性沖約，有遠識，寡嗜欲，與物無競。尤善談論，每以約言析理，以厭人之心，其所不知，默如也。裴楷嘗引廣共談，自夕申旦，雅相欽挹，歎曰：「我所不如也。」王戎為荊州刺史，聞廣為夏侯玄所嘗，乃舉為秀才。楷又薦廣于賈充，遂辟太尉掾，轉太子舍人。尚書令衛瓘，朝之耆舊，逮與魏正始中諸名士談論，見廣而奇之，曰：「自昔諸賢既沒，常恐微言將絕，而今乃復聞斯言於君矣。」命諸子造焉，曰：「此人之水鏡，見之瑩然，若披雲霧而睹青天也。」王衍自言：「與人語甚簡至，及見廣，便覺己之煩。」其為識者所歎美如此。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:p001:m0015"}],"reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null,"interpretation_note":"方參夏侯玄軍事；不是原文連續稱參征西將軍軍事，不造未出現完整官銜。","fixed_source_fact_binding":{"kind":"fixed_witness_person_fact_slots","key":"jin043-leguang-finite","slot":"fang-staff"},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang","source_term":"參魏征西將軍夏侯玄軍事","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-043-leguang:p001","start":17,"end":28,"surface":"參魏征西將軍夏侯玄軍事"},"source_revision":2618531,"paragraph_sha256":"caa56aed6a9431e46905f8f7812b8cabaff62ae92d5448a2f4569b8590489a60","date_expression":null,"kind":"official_duty","values":{"duty_code":"military_staff_service","organ_source_name":"魏征西將軍夏侯玄軍事","leader_person_id":"b39_52d_971","formal_office_title":null}}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-jin043-leguang-guang-father","status":"source_attested","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-043","source_id":"s-jinshu-043-ws2618531-leg